"POWER ALERT — DUST COVERAGE DETECTED • ENERGY LEVELS LOW": "POWER ALERT • DUST ON THE PANELS • LOW ENERGY",
"ELECTROSTATIC REGOLITH DUST ACCUMULATION": "MOON DUST IS BUILDING UP",
