"Guidance tether active! Subterranean habitat shielding confirmed at 100% capacity. Proceed cadets!": "Follow the safety rope! The shelter shield is working. Go, cadets!",
"\"Cadet, our orbital space weather satellite has confirmed a sudden Solar Particle Event! Solar energetic particles travel fast and can pose a serious radiation hazard outside. We must suspend outdoor activities and enter the thick regolith-shielded storm shelter now. Crew safety always comes first!\"": "\"Cadet, our weather satellite spotted a solar storm! Tiny fast particles from the Sun can be dangerous outside. We must stop work outdoors and go into the thick storm shelter now. Staying safe always comes first!\"",
"Cadet, our orbital space weather satellite has confirmed a sudden Solar Particle Event! Solar energetic particles travel fast and can pose a serious radiation hazard outside. We must suspend outdoor activities and enter the thick regolith-shielded storm shelter now. Crew safety always comes first!": "Cadet, our weather satellite spotted a solar storm! Tiny fast particles from the Sun can be dangerous outside. We must stop work outdoors and go into the thick storm shelter now. Staying safe always comes first!",
