"Stay outdoors to take photos of the solar phenomenon": "Stay outside and take photos of the Sun",
"Stop outdoor activities and enter the protected regolith shelter (Correct)": "Stop work outside and go into the shelter (Correct)",
"Fly back to Earth immediately": "Fly back to Earth right away",
"Mission Protocol Confirmed!": "Correct!",
"Excellent discovery, Cadet! Crew safety always comes first.": "Great job, Cadet! Staying safe always comes first.",
"“Space radiation is an important challenge for human exploration beyond Earth's protective atmosphere and magnetic shield.”": "“Space radiation is a big challenge for astronauts who travel beyond Earth's air and magnetic shield.”",
"Space radiation is an important challenge for human exploration beyond Earth's protective atmosphere and magnetic shield.": "Space radiation is a big challenge for astronauts who travel beyond Earth's air and magnetic shield.",
"NASA's Human Research Program studies radiation exposure so Artemis astronauts can live safely on the Moon and travel onward to Mars.": "NASA scientists study space radiation so astronauts can live safely on the Moon and one day travel to Mars.",
"Galactic Cosmic Rays": "Rays from far away in space",
