"Extract oxygen gas & microwave-sinter into landing pad blast bricks.": "Oxygen to breathe, and bricks for building a landing pad.",
"Anorthosite and ilmenite chunks rich in calcium and titanium.": "Rocks with calcium and titanium inside.",
"Structural building frames, solar panel silicon, & thermal heat storage.": "Metal for building, silicon for solar panels, and a way to store heat.",
"Deep frozen ice traps buried inside cryogenic South Pole craters.": "Frozen ice hidden in very cold South Pole craters.",
"Drinking water, breathable O2 for habitats, & liquid H2 rocket fuel!": "Drinking water, oxygen to breathe, and rocket fuel!",
"High peaks that bathe in nearly continuous solar exposure all year.": "High mountain tops where the Sun shines almost all the time.",
"24/7 solar electricity to continuously power thermal furnaces and ice rovers.": "Solar power day and night, for heaters and ice rovers.",
"ISRU PROCESSOR ONLINE: Select any sample above to initiate automated chemical separation sequence...": "Tap a sample above to see what we can make from it.",
"Question: “What does In-Situ Resource Utilization (ISRU) mean in space exploration?”": "Question: What does ISRU mean?",
