"“Scientists are researching methods to extract oxygen directly from lunar regolith and confirm water ice in shadowed craters. Making fuel on the Moon will transform future space voyages!”": "“Scientists are finding ways to make oxygen from Moon soil and to check for ice in dark craters. Making fuel on the Moon could change space travel!”",
"Scientists are researching methods to extract oxygen directly from lunar regolith and confirm water ice in shadowed craters. Making fuel on the Moon will transform future space voyages!": "Scientists are finding ways to make oxygen from Moon soil and to check for ice in dark craters. Making fuel on the Moon could change space travel!",
